9cdc82112fda3786efbe8ecef5bb8d25198fcd6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really good game, clearly game of the year.", "timestamp_created": 1700088518, "timestamp_updated": 1700088518, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "150193642", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043490919", "personaname": "Olfer", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cogoforce/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 20291, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8959, "last_played": 1727480648, "avatar": "1aee7730f7f02e677aba933b4a0227ca06d9afdc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game, nice balance between Shoot/Skills/Melee with a huge pint of Souls-like. Story is no that great but more like a mash up of worlds and loosed lore which I really like. Graphics are great and combat feels very smooth. Try it totally worth the price.", "timestamp_created": 1700088285, "timestamp_updated": 1700088285, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "150193370", "author": {"steamid": "76561199542156568", "personaname": "Hécate", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199542156568/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 35, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 31, "last_played": 1705527625, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Unplayable game with Proton on Fedora 39. Despite having an AMD RX 6600 and a Ryzen 5 I cannot go past the character screen because the interface is horrendously slow. This is also reported on the ProtonDB page: https://www.protondb.com/app/1282100", "timestamp_created": 1700087884, "timestamp_updated": 1700087884, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501100480556488037", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "150193099", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119218980", "personaname": "Adventurer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198119218980/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 7962, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4871, "last_played": 1733197172, "avatar": "1c0b5c37a442a2d39f32902ec42f2e26ba6a142e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game just like the first one. Something I also enjoy about this game and the previous one was that the standard version of the game + the 2 DLC works its price out to $60, the standard AAA game price (Remnant 1) and $70, the new AAA game price (Remnant2). \n\nThis is how games should be sold, Full game and Content for a Full Price. Not $70 for base game and then $30 for each DLC after that is overall mediocre gameplay.\n\nBoth Remnant games have done everything right.", "timestamp_created": 1700087476, "timestamp_updated": 1700087476, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "150192985", "author": {"steamid": "76561198934530376", "personana